# Getters and Setters (`get` / `set`) 🎛️

Control and validate property modifications:

```typescript
class UserProfile {
  private _age: number = 0;

  get age(): number {
    return this._age;
  }

  set age(value: number) {
    if (value < 0 || value > 120) {
      throw new RangeError("Age must be between 0 and 120!");
    }
    this._age = value;
  }
}

const profile = new UserProfile();
profile.age = 25; // Invokes setter!
console.log("Profile Age:", profile.age); // Invokes getter!
```

