# Static Members (`static`) ⚡

Static members are attached to the class constructor itself, not created on each instance:

```typescript
class DatabaseConnection {
  static defaultPort: number = 5432;

  static createConnectionString(host: string, db: string): string {
    return `postgres://${host}:${DatabaseConnection.defaultPort}/${db}`;
  }
}

console.log("Default Port:", DatabaseConnection.defaultPort);
console.log(DatabaseConnection.createConnectionString("db.internal", "app_prod"));
```

